url":"https://mp.newsbreakapp.com/post/55443321?sig=E9132980F1E842589CB83278F74B20D3","picked_location":{"name":"Minnesota","coord":"46.729553,-94.6859","address":"Minnesota, USA","id":"ChIJmwt4YJpbWE0RD6L-EJvJogI","type":"place_id","displayName":"Minnesota"},"reject_details":{},"enable_hybrid":true,"content_quality":"detrimental","content_type":"ARTICLE","date_str":"2023-09-22","city_name":"Minnesota","doc_meta":{"first_category":"PoliticsGovernment","second_category":"PoliticsGovernment_State","third_category":"PoliticsGovernment_State_PoliticsGovernment"},"is_full_article":true,"media_posts":0,"content":"\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTucked away in a drawer at the \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://mnhs.gitlab.io/archive/education-resources/www.mnhs.org/education/resources/28th-virginia-battle-flag.html\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__link\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMinnesota Historical Society\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e lies an obscure yet controversial artifact - a Confederate battle flag captured by a Minnesota regiment during the decisive Battle of Gettysburg.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis relic, the 28th Virginia Infantry flag, has been at the center of an ongoing dispute about whether it rightfully belongs to Minnesota or should be returned to its native Virginia.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2Fac7e3a4978c703e5184d76ad392f5229.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%2228th%20Virginia%20Infantry%20Color%20captured%20at%20Gettysburg%20by%20Private%20Marshall%20Sherman%2C%20Company%20C%2C%201st%20Minnesota%20Infantry%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Public%20Domain%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcommons.wikimedia.org%2Fwiki%2FFile%3A28th_Virginia_Infantry_Color.jpg%3Fuselang%3Den%23Licensing%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A591%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A558%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=1dkMNN_0oeykjac00\" data-image-caption=\"28th Virginia Infantry Color captured at Gettysburg by Private Marshall Sherman, Company C, 1st Minnesota Infantry\" data-credit-text=\"Public Domain\" data-credit-url=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:28th_Virginia_Infantry_Color.jpg?uselang=en#Licensing\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"591\" data-image-original-height=\"558\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=1dkMNN_0oeykjac00\" width=\"591\" height=\"558\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-caption\"\u003e28th Virginia Infantry Color captured at Gettysburg by Private Marshall Sherman, Company C, 1st Minnesota Infantry\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:28th_Virginia_Infantry_Color.jpg?uselang=en#Licensing\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePublic Domain\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__h2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpoils of War\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe flag was seized in 1863 by the courageous 1st Minnesota Infantry, who suffered immense casualties staving off Confederate forces at Gettysburg. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePrivate Marshall Sherman retrieved the dropped banner, earning himself a Medal of Honor.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAfter the war, the flag passed from federal to state hands, exhibited periodically at Minnesota's capitol. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIt became part of the Historical Society's permanent collection in 1896.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__h2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Controversy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBut since 1905, Virginia has argued that Confederate flags should be repatriated to their states of origin.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRequests for the 28th Virginia flag's return have been made in 1961, 1998, 2000, and 2013, only to be refused each time by Minnesota governors and state officials.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__h2\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSymbolizes Sacrifice\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTo Minnesotans, the flag symbolizes a brave regiment's heroic sacrifice. Some oppose returning it on principle, or to avoid glorifying the Confederate cause.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOfficials also argue Minnesota has legal ownership after more than 150 years.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMeanwhile, many in Virginia view reclaiming the banner as a point of state pride, honoring those who fought and died under its red silk and blue cross.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhile controversial as a Confederate emblem, to descendants it represents family heritage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2F8bb894019cc3037da0e8b25cb23d857e.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22Marshall%20Sherman%20poses%20with%20the%20flag%20in%201864%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Public%20Domain%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcommons.wikimedia.org%2Fwiki%2FFile%3AMarshall_Sherman_with_28th_Virginia_battle_flag.jpg%3Fuselang%3Den%23Licensing%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A401%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A640%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=1lBcyt_0oeykjac00\" data-image-caption=\"Marshall Sherman poses with the flag in 1864\" data-credit-text=\"Public Domain\" data-credit-url=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marshall_Sherman_with_28th_Virginia_battle_flag.jpg?uselang=en#Licensing\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"401\" data-image-original-height=\"640\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=1lBcyt_0oeykjac00\" width=\"401\" height=\"640\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-caption\"\u003eMarshall Sherman poses with the flag in 1864\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marshall_Sherman_with_28th_Virginia_battle_flag.jpg?uselang=en#Licensing\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePublic Domain\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"NBAIE