and Saturday nights—also free to watch.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe food vendors are the main event. Fresh strawberries, strawberry shortcake piled with whipped cream, strawberry pie warm from the kitchen, plus regular carnival food. Each day brings different vendors, so regulars come back to hit different stalls.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2Fe95150828d7073a1f47df48c69b65215.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22City%20of%20Cottage%20Grove%20%7C%20Facebook%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fphoto%2F%3Ffbid%3D10152309088858484%26set%3Da.10152309073073484%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A960%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A640%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=2tPnbX_1CQoVzxq00\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-credit-text=\"City of Cottage Grove | Facebook\" data-credit-url=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=10152309088858484\u0026amp;set=a.10152309073073484\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"960\" data-image-original-height=\"640\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=2tPnbX_1CQoVzxq00\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=10152309088858484\u0026amp;set=a.10152309073073484\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eCity of Cottage Grove | Facebook\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBeyond eating, there's a carnival midway with rides and games, a petting farm with animals you can touch, and a car show where people park their restored vehicles. The Medallion Hunt is the real draw—organizers hide a physical medal somewhere in the park, and if you find it, you win money. People \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.familyfuntwincities.com/events/cottage-grove-strawberry-fest/\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__link\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003espend hours searching\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Grande Day Parade rolls through with floats and community groups. After dark, fireworks blast off above the park.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis year's theme is \"Pure Imagination.\" If you want to compete, there's a strawberry pie eating contest. The whole fest is designed to fit a few hours without a wallet hit.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cstyle style=\"display: none\"\u003e.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol1 {padding: 0 0 0 20px !important;margin: 0 0 24px 0 !important;list-style-position: outside !important;}.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol2 {padding: 0 !important;margin: 0 !important;list-style-type: lower-alpha !important;list-style-position: outside !important;}html body.post #content-div .content ol li ol {margin: 0 !important;}.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol3 {padding: 0 !important;margin: 0 !important;list-style-type: lower-roman !important;list-style-position: outside !important;}.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol4 {padding: 0;margin: 0;list-style-type: upper-roman !important;list-style-position: outside !important;}.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol5 {padd