_frame_cdn_url":""},"viewType":"web","vote":12},{"ai_summary":"","amp":"https://mp.newsbreakapp.com/post/162074057?sig=63777FEE7C91F8CC7B92142163608137","audio_file":"","audio_length_sec":0,"canonical_url":"https://mp.newsbreakapp.com/post/162074057?sig=63777FEE7C91F8CC7B92142163608137","certifications_badges":[{"dark_color":"#FF5A5A","dark_icon":"https://i.prt.news/t_200_200_ff128e59e44fd908bc949f34bde102c1.png","description":"Users in NewsBreak’s Contributor Program who have verified their accounts by showing some writing experience on other platforms.","es_description":"Usuarios en el Programa de Colaboradores de NewsBreak que han verificado sus cuentas mostrando algo de experiencia en redacción en otras plataformas.","light_color":"#FF5A5A","light_icon":"https://i.prt.news/t_200_200_ff128e59e44fd908bc949f34bde102c1.png","name":"writer","text":"Writer","type":"certification"}],"city_name":"Minnesota","comment_count":0,"comment_user_count":0,"content":"\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIf you love hiking and want to experience one of Minnesota's greatest outdoor treasures, the Superior Hiking Trail should be on your bucket list. This amazing trail stretches for 310 miles along the rocky ridges above Lake Superior, following the shoreline from the Minnesota-Wisconsin border all the way to the Canadian border in \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"(https://www.exploreminnesota.com/profile/superior-hiking-trail/1871)\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__link\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003enortheastern Minnesota\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2F7b3412ce8c626a5285fcea48f04c2806.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Jennifer%20A%20Singer%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A4032%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A3024%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=25slvN_1Bk0maJO00\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-credit-text=\"Jennifer A Singer\" data-credit-url=\"\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"4032\" data-image-original-height=\"3024\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=25slvN_1Bk0maJO00\" width=\"2016\" height=\"1512\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003eJennifer A Singer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Superior Hiking Trail is more than just a long path — it's a gateway to some of Minnesota's most beautiful wilderness. According to the \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"(https://superiorhiking.org/)\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__link\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSuperior Hiking Trail Association\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, the trail follows dramatic cliffs and rocky ridgelines that offer sweeping views of Lake Superior. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOn clear days, you can see the blue water stretching to the horizon. In autumn, the changing leaves create a colorful tunnel above the trail. The landscape includes boreal forests, waterfalls, and plenty of chances to spot wildlife like deer and birds.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2F80c0782e5c56cf8985461a5e70a09047.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Jennifer%20A%20Singer%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A853%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A640%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=2aUYW5_1Bk0maJO00\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-credit-text=\"Jennifer A Singer\" data-credit-url=\"\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"853\" data-image-original-height=\"640\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=2aUYW5_1Bk0maJO00\" width=\"853\" height=\"640\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003eJennifer A Singer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOne of the best things about the Superior Hiking Trail is that it's accessible to everyone. There are over 50 trailheads where you can start hiking, so you don't have to do the entire 310 miles . \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eYou can hike just one section for a few hours, spend a weekend backpacking, or tackle the whole trail if you're really ambitious. Many sections work perfectly for day hikes, especially in spring and summer when the weather is nice.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2Fb81a1a65880461c686824a64ca64d6c9.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Jennifer%20A%20Singer%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A3024%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A4032%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=1Oypgy_1Bk0maJO00\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-credit-text=\"Jennifer A Singer\" data-credit-url=\"\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"3024\" data-image-original-height=\"4032\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=1Oypgy_1Bk0maJO00\" width=\"1512\" height=\"2016\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003eJennifer A Singer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFor people who want to camp along the way, the trail offers something special: 94 free backcountry campsites spaced about 5 to 8 miles apart. Even better, there are no fees or permits required to hike the trail or use these campsites (https://superiorhiking.org/). That makes the Superior Hiking Trail one of the most affordable outdoor adventures you can have in Minnesota.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe trail also welcomes different types of hikers. Whether you want to backpack for several days, do a quick day hike, or even trail run, the Superior Hiking Trail has something for you. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe footpath is rugged and can be challenging, but that's part of what makes it so rewarding. Every bend in the trail reveals another viewpoint, another waterfall, or another moment of peace in nature.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cdiv data-editornodeinfo=\"%7B%22type%22%3A%22editor-image-node%22%2C%22imageUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.prt.news%2Fa5ea73092bb85f9e08b801274a5fff25.blob%22%2C%22imageCaption%22%3A%22%22%2C%22creditText%22%3A%22Jennifer%20A%20Singer%22%2C%22creditUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22imagePlatform%22%3A%22SELF_UPLOAD%22%2C%22imageOriginalWidth%22%3A480%2C%22imageOriginalHeight%22%3A640%7D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image-wrap\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"editor-image\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"\" src=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?type=thumbnail_580x000\u0026amp;url=4Vd3Dz_1Bk0maJO00\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-credit-text=\"Jennifer A Singer\" data-credit-url=\"\" data-image-platform=\"SELF_UPLOAD\" data-image-original-width=\"480\" data-image-original-height=\"640\" alt=\"https://img.particlenews.com/image.php?url=4Vd3Dz_1Bk0maJO00\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" \u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"image-introduction-wrap\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"photo-by\"\u003ePhoto by\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"credit-text\"\u003eJennifer A Singer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMay and June are perfect times to hike the Superior Hiking Trail. The weather is warming up, wildflowers are blooming, and the bugs aren't as bad as they'll be later in summer. If you're looking for your next Minnesota adventure, this 310-mile gem is waiting for you.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFor detailed trail maps and information about campsites, visit the Superior Hiking Trail Association at \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://superiorhiking.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__link\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ehttps://superiorhiking.org/\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"NBAIEditor_Theme__paragraph\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cstyle style=\"display: none\"\u003e.NBAIEditor_Theme__ol1 {padding: 0 0 0 20px !important;margin: 